<title>HONG KONG: Road King declares first interim results.</title>
<headline>Road King declares first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   23.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    110.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		     77.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 Road King Infrastructure Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Road King a spinoff of civil engineering group Wai Kee Holdings Ltd. It was listed on the Stock Exchange on July 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after share of profit of associated companies of HK$37.36 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
